      "rationale": "This simplification adds an operational-normal-form factor-folding fact beyond the primary recurrence; Stage 1 relies on it while proving the loop and provides no earlier exact proof against a module without the rule.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-03216b3b471d3a9d3f64484ebc0ff5a8d18bceade6710b43811706d8d0373c9b",
